.claude/

# Playwright storageState files.
# The Amazon Associates session-replay automation that produced these was RETIRED
# 2026-08-26 and must not be rebuilt (see wiki/synthesis/decisions-log.md). These
# patterns STAY as a safety net: a storageState for a financial account is a LIVE
# BEARER CREDENTIAL, and the cost of an accidental commit is far higher than the
# cost of two ignore lines that match nothing.
amazon-state.json
*-storage-state.json
